</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655162652">
<para id="fs-id1170655162655">8</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655162660">
<problem id="fs-id1170655160813">
<para id="fs-id1170655160815"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1170655213986">નીચેના અભ્યાસમાં, કિંમત શોધો.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655215373">
<problem id="fs-id1170655215375">
<para id="fs-id1170655215377"><newline /><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>જ્યારે</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>જ્યારે</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−33</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655106813">
<para id="fs-id1170655166976"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>−19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>−33</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655082419">
<problem id="fs-id1170655082421">
<para id="fs-id1170655082423"><newline /><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>જ્યારે</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>જ્યારે</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1170654938919"><emphasis effect="bold">પૂર્ણાંકોનો સરવાળો કરો</emphasis></para>
<para id="fs-id1166424899765">નીચેના અભ્યાસમાં, દરેક પદાવલીને સરળ બનાવો.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654938926">
<problem id="fs-id1170654938928">
<para id="fs-id1170654944664"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>−21</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>−59</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655219498">
<para id="fs-id1170655219500"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>−80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170654944793">
<problem id="fs-id1170654944795">
<para id="fs-id1170654943643"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>−35</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>−47</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
